## 📚 Practice Questions (SSC CGL Style – Fill in the Blanks):

1. She is poor, \_\_\_ she is honest.
   a) or
   b) yet
   c) for
   d) nor

   > ✅ **Answer: b) yet**

2. You will fail \_\_\_ you don’t work hard.
   a) so
   b) unless
   c) or
   d) but

   > ✅ **Answer: b) unless**

3. He is \_\_\_ intelligent \_\_\_ brave.
   a) both – and
   b) not only – and
   c) either – or
   d) whether – or

   > ✅ **Answer: a) both – and**

4. \_\_\_ he was tired, he kept working.
   a) Because
   b) Although
   c) If
   d) When

   > ✅ **Answer: b) Although**

5. I will call you \_\_\_ I reach home.
   a) after
   b) for
   c) and
   d) or

   > ✅ **Answer: a) after**

